---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/layout/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="HomeGeneratorGuide privacy policy: contact messages, hosting logs, current analytics and advertising status, and your choices.">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ href: '/', label: 'Home' }, { label: 'Privacy Policy' }]} />
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-bold text-primary">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-500">Last updated: 2026-10-03. This is a plain-language policy, not legal advice.</p>
    <div class="prose-hgg mt-6">
      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Contact messages:</strong> if you email us, we receive your address and message content to respond.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> no analytics tracking script is currently enabled. The site has no accounts or logins.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Cookies & advertising</h2>
      <p>No advertising script is currently enabled. We never accept advertising or payments from generator brands, dealers, or installers. We do not sell homeowner information or installation leads.</p>
      <p>If another service is introduced, we will update this policy to explain what it collects and your choices before enabling it.</p>
      <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
      <p>No live affiliate links are currently displayed, and we do not receive generator-brand, dealer, or installer referral fees. See our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">funding disclosure</a>.</p>
      <h2>Third-party services</h2>
      <p>Static hosting on Cloudflare processes standard edge/server logs to deliver pages. We run no databases and no user accounts.</p>
      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Block or delete cookies in your browser settings (site remains readable).</li>
        <li>Contact us to request correction or deletion of a message you sent.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>Content targets adult homeowners. We do not knowingly collect children's data and do not use interest-based targeting for children.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Privacy questions: see our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
